The app is in `src/` (`main.ts`, `board.ts`, `archive.ts`, `dom.ts`), and `./check` passes and all 26 visible tests pass on `./test` (2 of 15 runs used). I was unsure about a few points the brief leaves open: the rename input keeps its text after a successful rename, add and checklist-add are disabled until their list has loaded, and the one console 404 in the test run was not traced (probably the page's favicon).